     rrppcc        Generates the _r_p_c_._b_y_n_u_m_b_e_r map from rpc(5) for use by
                getrpcent(3).

     sseerrvviicceess   Generates the _s_e_r_v_i_c_e_s_._b_y_n_a_m_e map from services(5) for use by
                getservent(3).

     pprroottooccoollss  Generates the _p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l_s_._b_y_n_a_m_e and _p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l_s_._b_y_n_u_m_b_e_r maps
                from protocols(5) for use by getprotoent(3).

     aalliiaasseess    Generates the _m_a_i_l_._a_l_i_a_s_e_s and _m_a_i_l_._b_y_a_d_d_r maps from
